er occurred.\n\nhttps://1drv.ms/v/s!An1NAyUl2de3j80ofZrZSQrJ3nWfaw?e=PnLYWB\n\nSo this may related to #102219, but needs more confirmation.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe reproduction steps are pretty self-explanatory in the video, but since lowering the driver version fixed the issue, it needs to be confirmed by more people to determine if this is the clear cause.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A - I'll update this ASAP.","closed_by":{"login":"Creta5164","id":13521406,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTIxNDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13521406?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164","html_url":"https://github.com/Creta5164","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Creta5164/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102735/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102735/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}